OL,3,GNEWSACare home choir to rock final with
OL,4,AQueen hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home choir in south-east London
OL,7,Fis swapping Vera Lynn nostalgia for
OL,8,FQueen's rock classics as it gets ready
OL,9,Fto perform in the national final of
OL,10,FCare Sector's Got Talent.
OL,12,FResidents, staff and volunteers from
OL,13,Fthe Avery Songbirds choir at Beckenham
OL,14,FPark Care Home said they were going to
OL,15,Fadd a kind of magic to the event in
OL,16,FBirmingham on Wednesday.
OL,18,FThe choir has been rehearsing for weeks
OL,19,Fand will perform three Queen classics:
OL,20,FRadio Ga Ga, I Want to Break Free and
OL,21,FWe Will Rock You.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
