OL,3,GNEWSACare home choir to rock final with
OL,4,AQueen hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FWellbeing assistant and choir leader
OL,7,FSorrell O'Sullivan said the choice of
OL,8,Fsongs was also about challenging
OL,9,Fperceptions of life in a care home,
OL,10,Fadding: "We need to get rid of the
OL,11,Fstereotypes of Vera Lynn."
